# Design Doc: Role-Shaped Abilities Schema<br>
<br>
## Overview<br>
<br>
This design doc outlines a proposed schema for storing role-shaped abilities in TemporaryAIs. The goal is to enhance candidate profiles by incorporating role-specific skills and traits.<br>
<br>
## Proposed Schema<br>
<br>
The schema includes the following fields:<br>
<br>
* `role_id`: Unique identifier for the role.<br>
* `ability_name`: Name of the ability (e.g., &quot;Super Strength&quot;).<br>
* `description`: Brief description of the ability.<br>
* `source`: Source of the ability (e.g., book, game, or movie).<br>
* `context`: Context in which the ability is used.<br>
<br>
## Implementation<br>
<br>
The proposed schema will be implemented as a Python module, utilizing standard-library data structures and functions. The module will provide methods for adding, retrieving, and updating role-shaped abilities.<br>
```<br>
